When "direct" dependencies in gren.json is empty, the compiler crashes.
(see gren.json.fails)

% gren make Example
Compiling ...-- MODULE NOT FOUND ------------------------------------------- src/Example.gren

Yougren: Prelude.last: empty list
CallStack (from HasCallStack):
  error, called at libraries/base/GHC/List.hs:2004:3 in base:GHC.List
  errorEmptyList, called at libraries/base/GHC/List.hs:212:13 in base:GHC.List
  lastError, called at libraries/base/GHC/List.hs:207:29 in base:GHC.List
  last, called at compiler/src/Reporting/Render/Code.hs:88:28 in gren-0.6.3-inplace-common:Reporting.Render.Code
Detected problems in 1 module.


But with "core" in "direct" dependencies it compiles:
(see gren.json.works)

 % gren make Example
Success! Compiled 1 module.
